1
00:00:00,601 --> 00:00:02,571
(Howard:)Great couple of gals.

2
00:00:03,437 --> 00:00:04,767
(Mr. Rostenkowski:)I wouldn't go that far.

3
00:00:12,713 --> 00:00:14,703
(Sheldon:)Are you prepared to receive
your punishment?

4
00:00:18,886 --> 00:00:21,786
One second. I wanna put on some music.

5
00:00:23,290 --> 00:00:24,810
(Sheldon:)Why?

6
00:00:25,059 --> 00:00:28,719
I don't wanna disturb the people next door
while you discipline me.

7
00:00:35,402 --> 00:00:38,962
(Sheldon:)Very well, then.
Get over my knee. Let's begin.

8
00:00:45,913 --> 00:00:47,673
(Penny:)Oh, my.

9
00:00:48,082 --> 00:00:52,072
(Sheldon:)Excuse me. You're not supposed
to be enjoying this.

10
00:00:52,786 --> 00:00:55,486
(Amy:)Then maybe you should spank me harder.

11
00:00:58,659 --> 00:01:00,749
(Sheldon:)Maybe I will.

